2.1.0 (March 30, 2026)
Nufft init function now support string dtype.

2.0.0 (March 29, 2026)
We remove `pts` in Nufft construction, user now must use `setpts()` to set the trajectory.

1.2.1
Fix bug about dtype conversation in `ToeKspMSELoss`.

1.2.0
Support altering dtype (float32/float64) for `Nufft` and `ToeMSELoss` module.

1.1.1
Update README.md

1.1.0
We replace l2 loss with MSE loss, since `sqrt()` in l2 loss is numerically unstable, which might lead to `NaN` loss during backward in the previous version. We also add more examples - InvNufft is for kick-start, TV_SENSE is for advanced non-Cartesian reconstruction test.